                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7B8AA3' }}>FastAPI、LangGraph、Celery 的分层职责，以及鉴权收口的位置</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3370FF', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono',Consolas,monospace", width: 64 }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: '600', color: '#EAF0F8' }}>三项可控性设计</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7B8AA3' }}>受控工具网关 · 人工审批与断点恢复 · 重复消息下的可靠执行</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3370FF', fontFamily: "'JetBrains Mono',Consolas,monospace", width: 64 }}>04</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: '600', color: '#EAF0F8' }}>验收方法与结果</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7B8AA3' }}>58 项用例分 9 组，退出码判定，pytest 117 条全绿</Text>
